# Overrides for tools/bench-idf.sh's build (build-bench/), on top of the
# project's sdkconfig. The script regenerates build-bench/sdkconfig from
# both whenever either changes.

# The bench profiles (PROFILE_MODE PIN or GPIO) need GPIO48, which the
# Sidecar link uses for BCLK. This also turns off A8BB_SIDECAR_LOOPBACK.
# CONFIG_A8BB_SIDECAR_ENABLE is not set
